        ("cut 3: the betas the ratio summarized", "\\beta_E$ 2.029", app),
        ("cut 4: the dropped pointer's target still exists",
         "\\label{app:q1_refusal_dist}", app),
        # ROUND-28 SUBSTITUTION (funding, their §17): tab:roadmap's caption legend
        # sentence ("A holds by structure; B is one empirical demonstration ...;
